{"id": "f21ff302-1935-4832-971c-1c7abce49675", "timestamp": "2026-10-17T19:50:59.323404", "source": "user", "parent_id": "6ec9cd7b-edbb-4a8c-8953-40822d04ee40", "llm_message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"cache_prompt": false, "type": "text", "text": "{\"researcher_request\": \"请注意，本项目为纯方案设计任务（无需实际执行实验或生成虚构数据）。我们的研究目标是设计一个严谨的实验方案，评估并对比在随机动作下，JaxMARL在MPE Simple Spread环境中的每秒步数（steps-per-second, SPS）与其原始CPU实现版本的性能表现。\\n\\n目前已知的基础设定如下：\\n1. 测试对象包含JaxMARL（基于JAX、支持GPU加速）实现；\\n2. 原始CPU基准为来自PettingZoo的MPE（Multi-Agent Particle Environment）实现；\\n3. 测试环境为MPE Simple Spread环境。\\n\\n请先进行初步检查，并提交以下内容：\\n1. 检查工作区与相关环境信息；\\n2. 提出你的实验设计整体框架与方法构想（包括自变量控制、度量标准、软硬件配置基线等）；\\n3. 说明该方案所依赖的重要假设以及当前存在的不确定性。\\n现阶段请勿直接输出完整的设计报告终稿，待方案思路确认后再展开详述。\", \"required_handoff_stage\": \"plan\", \"approach_approved\": false, \"public_task\": {\"question\": \"How does the performance of JaxMARL in the MPE Simple Spread environment compare to its original CPU-based counterpart in terms of steps-per-second under random actions?\", \"context\": \"Design an experiment that answers the question. The researcher can clarify source-supported setup details by topic. Do not claim that an experiment was run.\", \"environment\": {\"runtime\": \"bubblewrap\", \"network\": \"disabled\", \"repository\": \"/workspace\", \"python\": \"python3\", \"software_environment\": \"system Python; project dependencies not preinstalled\", \"datasets\": [], \"gpu_enabled\": false, \"cpu_affinity_count\": 24, \"note\": \"Successful exploratory commands are not proof of a completed experiment.\"}, \"researcher_topics\": [\"neurips2024/97649/2:setup_4\", \"neurips2024/97649/2:setup_5\", \"neurips2024/97649/2:setup_9\"], \"question_budget\": 6, \"actor_step_budget\": 60, \"continue_after_initial_plan\": false}}"}], "tool_calls": null, "tool_call_id": null, "name": null}, "llm_response_id": null, "activated_skills": [], "extended_content": [], "sender": null, "kind": "MessageEvent", "source_event_index": 1}
